iRule(1)						BIG-IP TMSH Manual						  iRule(1)

AUTH_RESULT
       Replaces AUTH_SUCCESS. AUTH_FAILURE. AUTH_ERROR. and AUTH_WANTCREDENTIAL events.

DESCRIPTION
       This event replaces AUTH_SUCCESS, AUTH_FAILURE, AUTH_ERROR, and AUTH_WANTCREDENTIAL events. These four deprecated events
       will be removed from a future release. The specific result can be obtained using AUTH::status.

Examples
	when AUTH_RESULT {
	    if {[AUTH::status] != 0} {
		HTTP::respond 401
	    } else {
		HTTP::release
	    }
	}

HINTS
SEE ALSO
       https://devcentral.f5.com/wiki/iRules.client_cert_request_by_uri_with_ocsp_checking.ashx

CHANGE LOG
       @BIGIP-9.4.0 --First introduced the event.

BIG-IP							    2022-04-12							  iRule(1)

